    "appid": "a7c41f8e-3b2d-4e9a-bf56-1d8e9a4c2f7b",
    "name": "Proofpoint TRAP",
    "description": "Ingest and manage incidents from Proofpoint Threat Response Auto-Pull (TRAP) on-premises. NOTE: Before enabling polling, create a label (e.g. proofpoint_trap) in Administration > Event Settings > Labels, then select it in the asset Ingest Settings.",
